*aggregate demand* is the total amount of demand in an economy for its resources.

= Aggregate Demand

== What are the components of Aggregate Demand?
    + consumption          (C)
    + investment           (I)
    + government spending  (G)
    + net trade           (X-M)

So $A D = C + I + G + (X-M)$.

== Aggregate Demand Curves

